       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.     SPCSSDPT.
       AUTHOR.         JS BUNGO.
       INSTALLATION.   THE GOODYEAR TIRE AND RUBBER COMPANY - AKRON.
       DATE-WRITTEN.   APRIL 14, 1997.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *REMARKS.
      **************************************************************
      *                                                            *
      *D   SPCSSDPT     STOREROOM FRANCHISERS SUB PROGRAM          *
      *D                                                           *
      *D   KEY = "FRAN"                                            *
      *D   LIST OF STOREROOM FRANCHISERS.  FRANCHISE ID, FRANCHISE *
      *D   NAME (ABBREVIATION), AND FRANCHISE VENDOR CODE.         *
      *D   MAXIMUM OF 4 ENTRIES.                                   *
      *D                                                           *
      *D   ** COPIED FROM SPCSSDPT AND MODIFIED **                 *
      *D                                                           *
      *D   CALLED BY:    SSTROPT                                   *
      *D                                                           *
      **************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.  IBM-AS400.
       SPECIAL-NAMES. I-O-FEEDBACK IS I-O-FEEDBACK-AREA.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DISPLAY-FILE
                  ASSIGN TO WORKSTATION-ZSTARTUP-SI
                  ORGANIZATION IS TRANSACTION
                  ACCESS IS SEQUENTIAL
                  FILE STATUS IS DISPLAY-STATUS
                  CONTROL-AREA IS WS-CONTROL.
           SELECT MPLTINFO-O
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0501
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.
           SELECT DVENDOR-I
                  ASSIGN TO DATABASE-MCFLCS0701
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                  WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  DISPLAY-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  DISPLAY-REC                      PIC X(2000).
       FD  MPLTINFO-O
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0500 OF MCFLCS0501.
       FD  DVENDOR-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DVENDOR-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-MCRPCS0700 OF MCFLCS0701.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       77  SUB                              PIC 9.
       77  FIELD-NUMBER                     PIC 99.

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1                PIC X VALUE SPACE.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2                PIC X VALUE SPACE.

       01  TODAY-DATE.
           05  YY                           PIC XX.
           05  MM                           PIC XX.
           05  DD                           PIC XX.

      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **              D A T A    B A S E    A R E A              **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       COPY MPLTINFO IN COPYLIB.

       01  MPLTINFO-ARG                PIC X(4).
       COPY DBSTAT IN COPYLIB.
       01  MESSAGE-BUFFER.
           05  MSG-TEXT                    PIC X(64)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD                     PIC X(12)  VALUE SPACES.
           05  MSG-FLD-9 REDEFINES MSG-FLD
                                           PIC Z(11)9.

       COPY DVENDOR IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **                 TERMINAL I/O DATA AREA                  **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       01  STRCFRAN-SCREEN.
           05  STRCFRAN-TABLE.
               10  STRCFRAN-LINE OCCURS 4 TIMES.
                   15  STRCFRAN-ID       PIC X(1).
                   15  STRCFRAN-NAME     PIC X(4).
                   15  STRCFRAN-VEN-CODE PIC X(10).
           05  STRCFRAN-MSGLINE          PIC X(79).
           05  CMDLINE                   PIC X(79).
           05  ERR-MSGLINE               PIC X(79).

       COPY TBLOWUP IN COPYLIB.
       COPY CATREAD IN COPYLIB.
       COPY DISPDATA IN COPYLIB.
       COPY IOFEEDBACK IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **               LINKAGE   SECTION                         **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      *************************************************************

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  BASE                          PIC X(10).

       COPY VCOMLINK IN COPYLIB.

       COPY LANGSUB IN COPYLIB.

      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************
      **                                                         **
      **          P R O C E D U R E    D I V I S I O N           **
      **                                                         **
      *************************************************************
      **#########################################################**
      *************************************************************

       PROCEDURE DIVISION USING BASE,
                                VIEW-COMAREA,
                                LANGUAGE-PARMS.


       MAIN-PGM SECTION 01.

       BEGIN-HERE.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.

       1-HSK.
           MOVE "SPCSFRAN" TO BU-PGM-NAME.
           OPEN I-O DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O.
           OPEN INPUT DVENDOR-I.
           ACCEPT TODAY-DATE FROM DATE.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE DISPLAY-FILE, MPLTINFO-O, DVENDOR-I.
           GOBACK.

      ******************************************************
      **                 BLOWUP ROUTINE                   **
      ******************************************************

       2-BLOWUP.
           CALL "TBLOWUP" USING BASE, BU-PGM-NAME, STATUS-AREA,
               VIEW-COMAREA, FILE-STATUS, BU-DISPLAY-MSG,
               BU-DISPLAY-AREA.

      **************************************************
      *                                                *
      *                  6 - M A I N                   *
      *                                                *
      **************************************************

       6-MAIN.
           MOVE "STRCFRAN" TO VIEW-NFNAME.

       6-READ-DATABASE.
           MOVE SPACES TO STRCFRAN-SCREEN.
           PERFORM 61-READ-MPLTINFO.

       6-PUT-BUFFER.

      ***  INPUT DATA ABOVE AND PRESS 'ENTER'  ***
           MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM.
           MOVE  20 TO LANG-MSGNUM.
           PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO STRCFRAN-MSGLINE.

       6-SHOW-FORM.
           MOVE STRCFRAN-SCREEN TO DISPLAY-REC.
           PERFORM 998-WRITE-SCREEN THRU 998-READ-SCREEN.
           MOVE DISPLAY-REC     TO STRCFRAN-SCREEN.

       6-READ-FIELDS.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 3
               GO TO 6-MAIN-X.
           IF VIEW-LASTKEY = 1 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 2 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 4 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 5 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 6 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 7 OR
              VIEW-LASTKEY = 8
      *****    INVALID FUNCTION KEY    *****
               MOVE   9 TO LANG-SETNUM
               MOVE  10 TO LANG-MSGNUM
               PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
               MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
               MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

           MOVE SPACES TO ERR-MSGLINE.
           PERFORM 61-EDIT-DATA THRU 61-EDIT-EXIT
               VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1
                  UNTIL SUB > 4 OR ERR-MSGLINE > SPACES.
           IF ERR-MSGLINE > SPACES
               GO TO 6-SHOW-FORM.

       6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "FRAN" TO MPLTINFO-ARG, BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE STRCFRAN-TABLE TO MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES
               IF MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES = SPACES
                   DELETE MPLTINFO-O
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-DELETE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       MOVE "1DELETE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   END-IF
               ELSE
                   REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                       INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-REWRITE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       MOVE "1REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES          TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "FRAN"          TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               MOVE STRCFRAN-TABLE  TO MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES
               IF MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES NOT = SPACES
                   WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-WRITE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      MOVE "1WRITE MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                      PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE "1READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.

      *-------- WRITE VENDOR ID TO ABSTFILE SEQUENCE RECORD.
           MOVE "FRAS" TO MPLTINFO-ARG, BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1).
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 4
                   MOVE STRCFRAN-ID (SUB) TO
                                        MPLTINFO-FRAN-VEND (SUB)
               END-PERFORM
               IF MPLTINFO-FRAN-DATA = SPACES
                   DELETE MPLTINFO-O
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-DELETE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       MOVE "2DELETE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   END-IF
               ELSE
                   REWRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                       INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-REWRITE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                       MOVE "2REWRITE ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                           TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 = "2"
               MOVE SPACES          TO BUF-MPLTINFO
               MOVE "FRAS"          TO MPLTINFO-KEY
               PERFORM VARYING SUB FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL SUB > 4
                   MOVE STRCFRAN-ID (SUB) TO
                                        MPLTINFO-FRAN-VEND (SUB)
               END-PERFORM
               IF MPLTINFO-FRAN-DATA NOT = SPACES
                   WRITE MPLTINFO-O-REC FROM BUF-MPLTINFO
                      INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
                   END-WRITE
                   IF FILE-STATUS NOT = "00"
                      MOVE "2WRITE MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                       TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
                      PERFORM 2-BLOWUP
                   END-IF
               END-IF
           ELSE
               MOVE "2READ MPLTINFO ERROR IN 6-REPLACE-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.


       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.

       61-READ-MPLTINFO.
           MOVE "FRAN" TO MPLTINFO-ARG.
           MOVE MPLTINFO-ARG TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           READ MPLTINFO-O INTO BUF-MPLTINFO
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                MOVE MPLTINFO-FRANCHISES   TO STRCFRAN-TABLE
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STATUS-1 NOT = "2"
               MOVE "READ ERROR IN 61-READ-MPLTINFO"
                   TO BU-DISPLAY-MSG
               MOVE "FRAN" TO BU-DISPLAY-FLD (1)
               PERFORM 2-BLOWUP.
      *------- DO A START > HIGH-VALUES TO UNLOCK
           MOVE HIGH-VALUES TO PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC.
           START MPLTINFO-O KEY > PLTINFOKEY OF MPLTINFO-O-REC
               INVALID KEY MOVE "00" TO FILE-STATUS.

       61-EDIT-DATA.
           IF STRCFRAN-LINE (SUB) > SPACES
               IF STRCFRAN-ID (SUB) = SPACES
      *****    REQUIRED FIELD          *****
                   MOVE  20 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  62 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
                   COMPUTE FIELD-NUMBER = 3 * SUB - 2
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
                                IND(FIELD-NUMBER)
               ELSE
               IF STRCFRAN-NAME (SUB) = SPACES
      *****    REQUIRED FIELD          *****
                   MOVE  20 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  62 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
                   COMPUTE FIELD-NUMBER = 3 * SUB - 1
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
                                IND(FIELD-NUMBER)
               ELSE
               IF STRCFRAN-VEN-CODE (SUB) = SPACES
      *****    REQUIRED FIELD          *****
                   MOVE  20 TO LANG-SETNUM
                   MOVE  62 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                   PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                   MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
                   COMPUTE FIELD-NUMBER = 3 * SUB
                   MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
                                IND(FIELD-NUMBER)
                ELSE
                    MOVE STRCFRAN-VEN-CODE (SUB) TO
                         VENCDE OF DVENDOR-I-REC
                    MOVE "00" TO VENITMNO OF DVENDOR-I-REC
                    READ DVENDOR-I INTO BUF-DVENDOR
                        INVALID KEY
      *****    VENDOR CODE DOES NOT EXIST *****
                          MOVE  22 TO LANG-SETNUM
                          MOVE   3 TO LANG-MSGNUM
                          PERFORM 999-CATREAD THRU 999-CATREAD-EXIT
                          MOVE MESSAGE-BUFFER TO ERR-MSGLINE
                          COMPUTE FIELD-NUMBER = 3 * SUB
                          MOVE B"1" TO IND(99)
                                       IND(FIELD-NUMBER)
                    END-READ
                END-IF
                END-IF
                END-IF
           END-IF.
       61-EDIT-EXIT.
           EXIT.


       COPY DISPCALL IN COPYLIB.
      *********************************************************
       999-CATREAD.
           IF CATREAD-MSG-NUMBER = ZEROS
               MOVE LANG-SETNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-SET
               MOVE LANG-MSGNUM TO CATREAD-MSG-NUM.
           CALL "CCATREAD" USING CATREAD-PARMS.
           MOVE CATREAD-MSG-TEXT TO MESSAGE-BUFFER.
       999-CATREAD-EXIT.
           EXIT.
